        <Text>One the data was cleaned, Python code was develop to analyze the data. Basic data analysis was performed to confirm the target questions could be answered with the data acquired, and for data to be grouped allowing the analysis process to be developed as restrictions are known. 
Statistics were generate on the cleaned .CSV file for the attributes, counts, mean, median, standard deviation, min/max, and 25th/75th percentile of the valid .CSV file, as relevant based on the data information. This was performed by using a script developed by Tristen Garcia, called “summarystats.py”, with the following table completed by Tristen Garcia.
